[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13577.189, "timestamp": "03:46:17", "text": "技术上来说，嗨。 太酷了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13580.87, "timestamp": "03:46:20", "text": "我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13583.189, "timestamp": "03:46:23", "text": "认为，如果你能流利地交谈，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13585.91, "timestamp": "03:46:25", "text": "理解他们所说的话，并且"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13589.11, "timestamp": "03:46:29", "text": "保持专注，积极回应，那么面试就有可能通过。另外，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13592.07, "timestamp": "03:46:32", "text": "当他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13595.269, "timestamp": "03:46:35", "text": "给你看图片"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13598.309, "timestamp": "03:46:38", "text": "或剧本时，你也应该"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13600.71, "timestamp": "03:46:40", "text": "能够识别并阅读。 是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13603.429, "timestamp": "03:46:43", "text": "那也是必要的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13608.389, "timestamp": "03:46:48", "text": "不，是吗？ 是的。 他们说，嗯，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13612.469, "timestamp": "03:46:52", "text": "6月10日去的时候。 不，他们说我问过我，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13617.11, "timestamp": "03:46:57", "text": "我能不能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13619.189, "timestamp": "03:46:59", "text": "转学？ 他们说，"}]